Package: recycle
Type: Package
Title: Smart Function Result Caching with Custom Argument Comparison
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides intelligent caching of function results by comparing 
    function arguments using customizable comparison logic. Supports comparing 
    functions by code (ignoring environments), reading file contents instead of 
    comparing paths, and other flexible argument transformations before 
    determining if a re-run is necessary.
